dead code elimination command

sail --dead-code-elimination --dead-code-elimination-output-file basic_if --dead-code-elimination-assumptions-file ./test/non_interference/dead_code_assumptions/HelloWorld ./test/non_interference/dead_code_inputs/dc_basic_if.sail

